/**
 * DataGrid-specific display hints. Inherits all properties from {@link Ann.Ui} and can be used to provide
 * DataGrid-specific overrides when different behavior is needed for grid display vs other UI contexts.
 *
 * Normally all fields are included in the grid display but methods/properties are not. Use {@link Ann.Ui#show}
 * to include methods/properties and {@link Ann.Ui#hide} to exclude fields.
 *
 * @see DataGrid.Objs
 */
@annotation(appliesTo=['field', 'function'])
type Ann.DataGrid mixes Ann.Ui
